35-39; 8:13,14; 15:26,27; 19:35; 21:24; Ac 1:22; 5:32 1Jo 5:9-12; Re 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-18","title":"John 12:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-19","title":"John 12:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Perceive. 11:47-50; Mt 21:15; Lu 19:47,48; Ac 4:16,17; 5:27,28 the world. 3:26; 17:21; Ps 22:27; 49:1; Isa 27:6; Ac 17:6; 1Jo 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-20","title":"John 12:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Greeks. 7:35; Mr 7:26; Ac 14:1; 16:1; 17:4; 20:21; 21:28; Ro 1:16; 10:12 Ga 2:3; 3:28; Col 3:11 to worship. 1Ki 8:41-43; Isa 11:10; 60:2-14; 66:19-21; Ac 8:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-21","title":"John 12:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Philip. 1:43-47; 6:5-7; 14:8,9 we would. 1:36-39; 6:40; Mt 2:2; 8:9-12; 12:19-21; 15:22-28; Lu 19:2-4 Ro 15:8-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-22","title":"John 12:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Andrew. 1:40,41; 6:8 Andrew and. Mt 10:5; Mr 10:13,14; Lu 9:49,50</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-23","title":"John 12:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>The hour. 13:31,32; 17:1-5,9,10; Isa 49:5,6; 53:10-12; 55:5; 60:9; Mt 25:31 1Pe 2:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-24","title":"John 12:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Except. Ps 72:16; 1Co 15:36-38 if. 32,33; Ps 22:15,22-31; Isa 53:10-12; Heb 2:9,10; Re 7:9-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-25","title":"John 12:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>that loveth. Mt 10:39; 16:25; 19:29; Mr 8:35; Lu 9:23,24; 17:33; Ac 20:24; 21:13 Heb 11:35; Re 12:11 hateth. Ge 29:30-33; Ec 2:17; Lu 14:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-26","title":"John 12:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>serve. 13:16; 14:15; 15:20; Lu 6:46; Ro 1:1; 14:18; 2Co 4:5; Ga 1:10 Col 3:24; 4:12; 2Pe 1:1; 1Jo 5:3; Jude 1:1 let. 10:27; 21:22; Nu 14:24; 32:11; Mt 16:24; Mr 8:34; Lu 9:23; Eph 5:1,2 Re 14:4 where. 14:3; 17:24; Ps 17:15; Mt 25:21; 2Co 5:8; Php 1:23; 1Th 4:17,18 him. 14:21-23; 1Sa 2:30; Pr 27:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-27","title":"John 12:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>is. 11:33-35; 13:21; Ps 69:1-3; 88:3; Isa 53:3; Mt 26:38,39,42 Mr 14:33-36; Lu 22:44,53; Heb 5:7 what. Isa 38:15; Lu 12:49,50 Father. 11:41; Mt 26:53,54 but. 18:37; Lu 22:53; 1Ti 1:15; Heb 2:14; 10:5-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-28","title":"John 12:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Father. 18:11; Mt 26:42; Mr 14:36 Then. Mt 3:17; 17:5; 2Pe 1:17 I have. 9:3; 11:4,40-44 and will. 13:31,32; Isa 49:3-7; Eph 2:7; 3:10,21; Php 1:6-11; Re 5:9-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-29","title":"John 12:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>thundered. Ex 19:16; 20:18; Job 37:2-5; 40:9; Eze 10:5; Re 6:1; 8:5; 11:19; 14:2 An angel. Ac 23:8,9; Re 18:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-30","title":"John 12:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapter