},"content":"<p>believe. 1:7; 3:21; Isa 60:1; Ac 13:47,48 the children. Lu 16:8; Eph 5:8; 1Th 5:5,8; 1Jo 2:9-11 and departed. 8:59; 10:39,40; 11:54; Mt 21:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-37","title":"John 12:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>1:11; 11:42; 15:24; Mt 11:20; Lu 16:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-38","title":"John 12:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>That. 15:25; 17:12; 19:24,36,37; Mt 27:35; Ac 13:27-29 Esaias. 2Ch 32:20 Isaiah. Mt 15:7; Ac 8:28-30; Ro 10:20 who. Isa 53:1; Ro 10:16 the arm. Ps 44:3; Isa 40:10,11; 51:5,9; 1Co 1:24 revealed. Mt 16:17; 2Co 3:14-18; 4:3-6; Ga 1:16; Eph 1:17-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-39","title":"John 12:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>they. 5:44; 6:44; 10:38; Isa 44:18-20; 2Pe 2:14 because. Isa 6:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-40","title":"John 12:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>hath. 9:39; 1Ki 22:20; Isa 29:10; Eze 14:9; Mt 13:13-15; 15:14; Mr 4:12 Lu 8:10; Ac 28:26; Ro 11:8-11 hardened. Ex 4:21; 7:3,13; 14:4,8,17; Jos 11:20; Ro 9:18; 11:7; *marg: that they. De 29:4; Ps 135:10-18; Isa 26:11; 42:19,20; Jer 5:21; Eze 12:2 Mr 8:17,18 and be. Ac 3:19; 15:3; Jas 5:19,20 heal. Ps 6:2; 41:4; 147:3; Isa 53:5; 57:18,19; Jer 3:22; Ho 6:1; 14:4 Lu 4:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-41","title":"John 12:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>when. Isa 6:1-5,9,10 saw. 1:14,18; 14:9; Ex 33:18-23; 2Co 4:6; Heb 1:3 spake. 5:39; Ac 10:43; 1Pe 1:11; Re 19:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-12-42","title":"John 12:42","author":"R. A. Torrey